# Who must approve changes to what.
#
# The repository belongs to the personal account adamt-sudo, so GitHub cannot
# limit who may press "merge" to named people. Instead the main branch asks
# for "Require review from Code Owners": a change needs an approval from one
# of the owners below (and the checks must pass). The owner, as administrator,
# can still publish their own changes.
#
# When the reviewer is added, put their GitHub user name next to the owner's
# on every line, and on its own the English translations, which carry the
# "reviewed" flag that only the reviewer sets.
/content/cases/          @adamt-sudo
/content/case-order.json @adamt-sudo
/content/translations/   @adamt-sudo
/public/documents/       @adamt-sudo
/public/admin/           @adamt-sudo
/admin-oauth-worker/     @adamt-sudo
/.github/                @adamt-sudo
